                <pb facs="0630" n="508" xml:id="pg508"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Preston to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-12-10"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 10,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your note of Saturday just received. Being now empowered to sign protocol for
                    turning over the <hi rendition="#italic">Haytien Republic</hi> to the United
                    States, will send answer to note with draught protocol, and will be Thursday at
                    Department to sign protocol.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stephen Preston</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
